e5-8c66-2b2f8342d951"/> </div></form></div> </div> </div> <div class="pdp__description">Bring deliciously spicy flavours to whole chicken and chicken pieces with this tried-and-true chicken spice. Whether you&#39;re preparing chicken on the braai, in the oven or creating a mouth-watering stir-fry, this is the convenient and healthy solution to adding flavour to all your chicken recipes.</div> <span class="pdp__id">Product ID: 000000000010128844</span> </div> <div class="pdp__extras"> <div class="pdp__extras__extra-messages"> </div> <div class="pdp__share"> <span>Share this on</span> <ul class="pdp__share__list"> <li class="fb"> <button class="pdp__share__button fb" data-sharer="facebook" data-hashtag="Checkers" data-openInNewTab="true" data-disclaimer="Please have in mind that product price and availability is dependent on your store selection and may differ between stores!"> <?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?> <svg width="24px" height="24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" version="1.1" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"> <g id="Basics" stroke="none" stroke-width="1" fill="none" fill-rule="evenodd"> <g id="Icons" transform="translate(-306.000000, -1111.000000)"> <g id="Icons-/-Social-/-Facebook-Solid-/-Mobile" transform="translate(306.000000, 1111.000000)"> <circle id="Oval" fill="#637381" cx="12" cy="12" r="12"></circle> <path d="M14.4737738,8.06876898 L13.1518736,8.06876898 C12.934713,8.06876898 12.6297537,8.17891351 12.6297537,8.64721507 L12.6297537,9.89701828 L14.4688551,9.89701828 L14.2534161,12.018237 L12.6297537,12.018237 L12.6297537,18.0587028 L10.1699125,18.0587028 L10.1699125,12.018237 L9,12.018237 L9,9.89452068 L10.1699125,9.89452068 L10.1699125,8.52108585 C10.1699125,7.53877649 10.629073,6 12.6521338,6 L14.4737738,6.00799235 L14.4737738,8.06876898 Z" id="Logo" fill="#FFFFFF"></path> </g> </g> </g> </svg></li> <li class="tw"> <button class="pdp__share__button tw" data-sharer="twitter" data-title="Checkers" data-hashtags=