</script> <div class="yCmsContentSlot productDetailsPageSectionUpSelling"> <div class="yCmsComponent productDetailsPageSectionUpSelling-component"> </div><div class="yCmsComponent productDetailsPageSectionUpSelling-component"> </div></div><div class="pdp__tabs"> <div class="pdp__tabs__container"> <div class="tabs js-tabs tabs-responsive"> <div class="tabhead"> <a href="">Description</a> <i class="icon shoprite-icon-chevron-down"></i> </div> <div class="tabbody"> <div class="pdp__tabs__tab"> Featuring spices like paprika, black pepper, cloves, pimento, nutmeg, sage and marjoram, this is the answer to creating the perfect chicken dish and adding delicious flavour to your recipes. This non-irradiated, tasty chicken spice is free from genetically modified ingredients, artificial colourants, preservatives and added MSG. It&#39;s certified halaal and kosher, so you can prepare your family&#39;s meals with confidence. This product is developed from the finest quality ingredients that are sustainably farmed and carefully selected to deliver fresh, delicious flavour.</div></div> <div class="tabhead"> <a href="">Product Information</a> <i class="icon shoprite-icon-chevron-down"></i> </div> <div class="tabbody"> <div class="pdp__tabs__tab"> <table class="pdp__product-information"> <tbody> <tr> <td>Product Brand</td> <td>Robertsons</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Product Width (mm)</td> <td>45</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Product Height (mm)</td> <td>125</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Product Length (mm)</td> <td>45</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Product Weight</td> <td>85g</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Product Gross Weight (g)</td> <td>214</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Product Depth (mm)</td> <td>45</td> </tr> <tr> <td>What's in the box</td> <td>1 x 85g Robertsons Chicken Spice</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Unit of Measure</td> <td>EA</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Main Barcode</td> <td>6001038275150</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <table class="pdp__product-information"> <tbody> <tr> <td>Ingredients</td> <td> Salt And/or Iodised Salt, Maize Flour, Paprika†, Black Pepper, Cloves, Pimento, Nutmeg, Sugar, Sage, Marjoram.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Allergens</td> <td> May contain cow's milk, egg, soya and wheat gluten.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Dietary Requirement</td> <td> Kosher, Halaal, Vegan-Friendly</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div><div class="yCmsContentSlot productDetailsPageSectionOtherInfo"> </div><div class="yCmsContentSlot productDetailsPageSectionCrossSelling"> </div></div> <footer class="footer"> <div class="wrap"> <div class="footer__top"> <div class="footer__top__col footer__top__col--accordion js-footer-col-accordion"> <h4 class="footer__title">Your Profile</h4> <ul class="footer__top__col__content"> <li class="yCmsComponent"> <a href="/login/register" class="link-ga-register-label link-ga-register-label--footer" title="Sign Up"><span>New to Shoprite?</span> Sign Up</a></li><li class="yCmsComponent"> <a href="/store-finder" title="Find a Store">Find a Store</a></li><li class="yCmsComponent"> <a href="/login" class="link-ga-register-label link-ga-register-label--footer" title="Sign In">Sign In</a></li></ul> </div> <div class="footer__top__col footer__top__col--customer-service footer__top__col--accordion js-footer-col-accordion"> <h4 class="footer__title">Customer Service</h4> <ul class="footer__top__col__content"> <li class="yCmsComponent"> <div class="content cms-paragraph"><div class="footer__whatsapp"><a class="footer__whatsapp__content" href="https://wa.me/27872405709"><img class="footer__whatsapp__logo" src="/_ui/responsive/common/images/whatsapp-logo.png" srcset="/_ui/responsive/common/images/whatsapp-logo.png 1x, /_ui/responsive/common/images/whatsapp-logo-2x.png 2x, /_ui/responsive/common/images/whatsapp-logo-3x.png 3x"/><span class="footer__whatsapp__text">Sign Up for Xtra Savings on WhatsApp by adding <strong>087 240 5709</strong> to your contacts.</span></a></div> </div></li><li class="yCmsComponent"> <div class="content cms-paragraph"><p class="footer__customer-care-info">Customer 